      "content": "thanks. i checked the undersides of the leaves for mites or aphids but i honestly don't see anything. like, i've been looking really closely with a magnifying glass and there's just nothing there, yet the holes keep appearing overnight. it's almost like they're just appearing out of nowhere. what else could it be if it's not visible insects?",
